  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Hei Lou Lan reports that Ma Hong Yun was taken by him after she tried to check the capture in Crimson Reed Marsh. Fairy Li Shan and Hei Lou Lan treat him as famous in metal path, with a blessed land of his own, and without Huang Jin bloodline, which makes Northern Plains Gu Immortals jealous once Ma Hong Yun’s capture is tied to Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s luck path true inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        678
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_ma_hong_yun",
        "loc_crimson_reed_marsh",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Lou Lan later ranks him with overpowering metal path battle strength, somewhat stronger than Hei Cheng, while nearly all of Northern Plains looks to deal with him over that inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        690
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_cheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fairy Li Shan introduces Fang Yuan, Qin Bai Sheng is already treated as a rank seven Gu Immortal whose battle strength matches Immortal Monkey King Shi Lei. He greets Fang Yuan without arrogance and later laughs openly while urging brotherly address.",
      "chapters": [
        736
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "meeting-fang-yuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_li_shan",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_shi_lei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He keeps a cool demeanor, presses toward sworn brotherhood under Fairy Li Shan’s mountain pledge Gu, and probes Fang Yuan’s background. Fang Yuan judges him able to turn a siege by Northern Plains Gu Immortals into a situation that benefits himself, and contrasts that cunning with Shi Lei’s more brutish style.",
      "chapters": [
        737
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "meeting-fang-yuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_mountain_pledge_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The agreed auction date places the sale in Qin Bai Sheng’s Bai Sheng blessed land inside Crimson Reed Marsh.",
      "chapters": [
        744
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bai-sheng-auction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_bai_sheng_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the time arrives he closes the blessed land entrance, takes the raised platform, and opens the auction himself.",
      "chapters": [
        750
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bai-sheng-auction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He randomizes the true auction order with specially prepared mortal Gu so nobody can manipulate which Immortal Gu sells first, and stands as middleman when a secret room’s Gu Immortal cannot show himself to complete a trade.",
      "chapters": [
        751
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bai-sheng-auction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He holds a rank six luck inspection Immortal Gu of his own that he refuses to sell, facing down a rank six bidder’s objection on the strength of his own rank seven cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        760
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bai-sheng-auction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_luck_inspection_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The auction is later remembered as one that involved the whole of Northern Plains, where a bid for a sandalwood sacred elephant egg once caused a huge commotion.",
      "chapters": [
        935
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bai-sheng-auction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Luo Po Valley, Fairy Jiang Yu and a black robed Gu Immortal address him as Lord Vice Envoy, name him a member of Shadow Sect, and say his soul was modified so he cannot remember that tie.",
      "chapters": [
        771
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shadow-sect-vice-envoy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_luo_po_valley",
        "char_fairy_jiang_yu",
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He lends ice heart Immortal Gu for the Lang Ya invasion as Shadow Sect’s Qin Bai Sheng, and during that assault he is the mysterious Shadow Sect Vice Envoy.",
      "chapters": [
        874
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shadow-sect-vice-envoy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_ice_heart_gu",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a soul path Gu Immortal who also cultivates metal path, and he uses five finger fist heart sword without sword path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        962
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shadow-sect-vice-envoy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Luo Po Valley comes under attack, Qin Bai Sheng calls off the Lang Ya blessed land assault and flees with half of Refinement Cauldron while Lang Ya land spirit is unable to fly out and give chase.",
      "chapters": [
        885
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "retreat-from-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "house_refinement_cauldron",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He names the attackers as Central Continent Gu Immortals investigating the collapse of Eighty-Eight True Yang Building, orders the Shadow Sect members out of Lang Ya blessed land, and leaves with many of Refinement Cauldron’s core Immortal Gu, bringing Xue Song Zi and the two exposed hairy man Gu Immortal traitors with him.",
      "chapters": [
        980
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "retreat-from-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
        "char_xue_song_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His two major trump cards are soul suppression, a soul path killer move, and five finger fist heart sword, a sword path killer move, and ordinary Gu Immortals cannot endure a single hit from either. At Luo Po Valley he then activates the valley’s true secret, and countless mystical lights shoot out of the valley and immobilize Feng Jiu Ge, whom he is set on restricting rather than the other Central Continent Gu Immortals present. Feng Jiu Ge stops resisting and the light drags him deep into the valley, and Qin Bai Sheng approaches a light and is drawn in after him.",
      "chapters": [
        923
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "restricting-feng-jiu-ge",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Central Continent Gu Immortals weighing the information returned from the battle note that he fought Feng Jiu Ge using five finger fist heart sword, and that the move was created by Bo Qing and was his signature killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        954
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "restricting-feng-jiu-ge",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bo_qing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside a Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable inheritance space he lures Feng Jiu Ge along with Fairy Ling Mei and Ao Xue, then ends his own life so winds of assimilation rise from his destroyed immortal aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        924
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-at-luo-po-valley",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_fairy_ling_mei",
        "char_fairy_ao_xue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the hundred days battle ends, he and Fairy Jiang Yu are counted among those sacrificed, and even that powerful figure is said to have been sacrificed inside Luo Po Valley.",
      "chapters": [
        925
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-at-luo-po-valley",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hui Feng Zi, taking Fang Yuan’s disguise for Feng Jiu Ge himself leaving Luo Po Valley, reads that escape as confirmation that Qin Bai Sheng is dead, and is unsurprised because he knew Qin Bai Sheng was heavily injured.",
      "chapters": [
        992
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-at-luo-po-valley",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hui_feng_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Originally, before Fang Yuan’s rebirth changed events, Qin Bai Sheng’s suicidal attack would have killed Feng Jiu Ge inside the Thieving Heaven true inheritance’s strange space as well.",
      "chapters": [
        1388
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-at-luo-po-valley",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_thieving_heaven_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When immortal zombie Bo Qing later wields five finger fist heart sword against a grand tribulation, its effect is far greater than when Qin Bai Sheng used it, amplified by Bo Qing’s own accumulated sword path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1008
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "legacy-of-five-finger-fist-heart-sword",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a scene of the past, before the Luo Po Valley battle, the operation to retake Modest Thatched Hut costs Chu Rong’s life, and Qin Bai Sheng gives up the Immortal Gu House rather than expose Shadow Sect’s identities ahead of their crucial plan.",
      "chapters": [
        1017
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "modest-thatched-hut-given-up",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_modest_thatched_hut",
        "char_chu_rong",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the unexpected incidents that struck Shadow Sect’s plans, his running into Feng Jiu Ge is named the clearest example, alongside Gu Immortal Shi Nu’s narrow survival.",
      "chapters": [
        1026
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-among-shadow-sects-own-surprises",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shi_nu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Bai Sheng’s own standing before he awakened his memories is later used to describe Eastern Sea’s Miao Ming Shen’s status.",
      "chapters": [
        1154
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-before-regaining-memories",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_miao_ming_shen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ranking rank seven experts in his head, Fang Yuan places Feng Jiu Ge and Qin Bai Sheng after he regained his memories above Domination Immortal Chu Du.",
      "chapters": [
        1202
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ranked-above-chu-du-after-regaining-his-memories",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chu_du"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan reasons that because Qin Bai Sheng captured Ma Hong Yun after he left Imperial Court blessed land, Shadow Sect also learned of the all living being’s luck true inheritance through him.",
      "chapters": [
        1304
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-ties-shadow-sect-to-the-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_imperial_court_blessed_land"
      ]
    }
